--
N5008 [temp.variadic]/5: a pack expansion in a braced-init-list
(`{sizeof(Ts)...}`, `{__is_same(T, Ts)...}`) expands to one
initializer-clause per element -- also in a function template body whose
only pack is a TYPE pack (the shape of libstdc++'s
__find_uniq_type_in_pack under std::variant).  Before, the pack name
resolved to its first element and the list collapsed to one element; the
same collapse hit call arguments `g(sizeof(Ts)...)`.
